{"pages":[{"segs":[["FAC U LT Y CO M M O N S 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,596.19719999999995,9,false],["FACULTY",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,306.77999999999997,116.00059999999996,80,false],["COMMONS",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,346.62,176.00059999999996,80,false],["PROFESSORS AND FACULTY",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,410.82000000000005,194.10059999999999,20,false],["HOW DO WE ACCOMPLISH THIS?",369.20000000000005,226.91469999999993,512.06000000000006,247.45469999999989,20,false],["Through our fulltime staff of nearly 100, and in",369.20000000000005,246.52969999999982,546.12200000000018,258.93169999999986,9,false],["partnership with many other USCM staff and",369.20000000000005,259.52969999999982,541.2890000000001,271.93169999999986,9,false],["volunteers, we help professors:",369.20000000000005,272.52969999999993,486.22700000000003,284.93169999999998,9,false],["•",369.20000000000005,298.52969999999999,373.34000000000003,310.93169999999998,9,false],["•",369.20000000000005,324.52969999999999,373.34000000000003,336.93169999999998,9,false],["FACULTYCOMMONS.COM",190.70620000000002,328.86919999999998,301.40620000000001,349.4092,20,false],["“If I could start Campus Crusade for Christ all over",145.40000000000001,365.52969999999999,340.39400000000006,377.93169999999998,9,false],["again, I would begin by including ministry with",145.40000000000001,378.52969999999999,327.37100000000021,390.93169999999998,9,false],["professors.” — Bill Bright",145.40000000000001,391.52969999999999,242.32999999999998,403.93169999999998,9,false],["•",369.20000000000005,363.52969999999999,373.34000000000003,375.93169999999998,9,false],["Grow in their faith journey in Christ and become",387.20000000000005,298.52969999999999,571.77200000000016,310.93169999999998,9,false],["leaders to emulate;",387.20000000000005,311.52969999999999,458.92999999999995,323.93169999999998,9,false],["Integrate their personal faith with their teaching,",387.20000000000005,324.52969999999999,573.69800000000009,336.93169999999998,9,false],["research, publishing and service as a holistic",387.20000000000005,337.52969999999999,555.87800000000016,349.93169999999998,9,false],["endeavor",387.20000000000005,350.52969999999999,422.53399999999999,362.93169999999998,9,false],["Include a Christian worldview in discussions",387.20000000000005,363.52969999999999,558.56000000000017,375.93169999999998,9,false],["throughout the campus community and the",387.20000000000005,376.52969999999999,551.63900000000012,388.93169999999998,9,false],["greater culture.",387.20000000000005,389.52969999999999,445.92500000000007,401.93169999999998,9,false],["WHAT DOES FACULTY COMMONS DO?",145.40000000000001,423.91469999999998,309.72000000000003,444.4547,20,false],["For more than 25 years we have pioneered faculty",145.40000000000001,443.52969999999999,333.17600000000004,455.93169999999998,9,false],["ministry under the name Christian Leadership",145.40000000000001,456.52969999999999,322.95200000000011,468.93169999999998,9,false],["Ministries. We are transitioning to our new name,",145.40000000000001,469.52969999999999,334.39100000000002,481.93169999999998,9,false],["Faculty Commons. We are excited about this change,",145.40000000000001,482.52969999999999,344.84000000000015,494.93169999999998,9,false],["as we believe this new identity will better position",145.40000000000001,495.52969999999999,335.02100000000013,507.93169999999998,9,false],["us to minister to both professors and students in the",145.40000000000001,508.52969999999999,342.48200000000008,520.93169999999998,9,false],["academy.",145.40000000000001,521.52970000000005,180.59900000000002,533.93169999999998,9,false],["HOW YOU CAN HELP",369.20000000000005,421.91469999999998,457.84000000000003,442.4547,20,false],["1. Cultivate A Vision For A Student-Faculty Ministry.",369.20000000000005,441.52969999999999,570.45800000000008,453.93169999999998,9,false],["What would your campus be like if Christian",369.20000000000005,454.52969999999999,538.1840000000002,466.93169999999998,9,false],["professors and students were united in reaching the",369.20000000000005,467.52969999999999,565.57100000000014,479.93169999999998,9,false],["university?",369.20000000000005,480.52969999999999,412.3370000000001,492.93169999999998,9,false],["2. Build Relationships. Professors often have few",369.20000000000005,506.52969999999999,553.96100000000001,518.93169999999998,9,false],["Christian friends on campus; your encouragement",369.20000000000005,519.52970000000005,559.91000000000008,531.93169999999998,9,false],["may make a real difference in their life.",369.20000000000005,532.52970000000005,516.35000000000014,544.93169999999998,9,false],["On campuses all over the world we help Christian",145.40000000000001,547.52970000000005,332.95100000000019,559.93169999999998,9,false],["faculty gather as a “transformed minority” of men",145.40000000000001,560.52970000000005,335.57000000000005,572.93169999999998,9,false],["and women who love the academy, who find the",145.40000000000001,573.52970000000005,324.34700000000009,585.93169999999998,9,false],["person and works of Jesus of Nazareth to be satisfying",145.40000000000001,586.52970000000005,350.58200000000011,598.93169999999998,9,false],["and true, and who look to Him as the beautiful hope",145.40000000000001,599.52970000000005,339.83600000000013,611.93169999999998,9,false],["for the world.",145.40000000000001,612.52970000000005,196.47500000000002,624.93169999999998,9,false],["3. Involve Profs In What You Are Already Doing.",369.20000000000005,558.52970000000005,551.13500000000022,570.93169999999998,9,false],["Professors would love to meet committed Christian",369.20000000000005,571.52970000000005,564.43700000000013,583.93169999999998,9,false],["students; some may be willing to speak at meetings or",369.20000000000005,584.52970000000005,571.67300000000023,596.93169999999998,9,false],["help with outreaches.",369.20000000000005,597.52970000000005,450.88400000000007,609.93169999999998,9,false],["We dream of the day when there are movements",145.40000000000001,638.52970000000005,327.38900000000001,650.93169999999998,9,false],["of Christian professors on every campus, circles",145.40000000000001,651.52970000000005,327.0920000000001,663.93169999999998,9,false],["of professors willing to wrestle with the ever-",145.40000000000001,664.52970000000005,317.06600000000003,676.93169999999998,9,false],["challenging question, “As a Christian, what should I",145.40000000000001,677.52970000000005,340.53800000000007,689.93169999999998,9,false],["do in the academy?”",145.40000000000001,690.52970000000005,221.423,702.93169999999998,9,false],["CONNECTING TO FACULTY COMMONS",369.20000000000005,629.91470000000004,533.94000000000005,650.4547,20,false],["You can find more helpful information at our website:",369.20000000000005,649.52970000000005,571.45700000000011,661.93169999999998,9,false],["www.facultycommons.com",369.20000000000005,662.52970000000005,472.89800000000002,674.93169999999998,9,false],["You can reach Faculty Commons at 972-516-0516 or",369.20000000000005,688.52970000000005,566.84900000000016,700.93169999999998,9,false],["by emailing: peter.culver@uscm.org",369.20000000000005,701.52970000000005,505.53099999999995,713.93169999999998,9,false]],"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612}]}